# This repository stores LF and checks out LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true gets CRLF in the
# working tree, while Biome formats to LF. Any file Biome has not rewritten
# then fails the format check for a reason that has nothing to do with its
# contents, and `git diff` shows nothing, so the report and the evidence
# disagree. Measured on 2026-08-11: restoring one untouched file with
# `git checkout` was enough to turn `npm run check` red.
#
# Nothing here is a Windows tool that needs CRLF. The Worker runtime, the test
# runner and the formatter all want LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
